    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im 5 days out from my gallbladder surgery and the pain in my stomach is actually getting worse and not better like it was yesterday. i also have a bit of a fever like 100.2 and when i press on my stomach it feels really hard and stiff. is this just part of the healing process? im kinda worried but i dont want to go back to the hospital if i dont have to",
