      "content": "but my surgeon is out of the office until monday and the ER is so far away. my friend said it's probably just internal inflammation from the incisions and that i'm just overthinking it because i'm stressed. if i just take a really high dose of tylenol, like like 4000mg at once, and keep the heating pad on, wouldn't that just calm the inflammation down so i can sleep through it until monday?",
